    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Handsigns, Cast Jutsus!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From easy-to-learn to hard-to-master jutsus, Learn the RIGHT combinations and craft your own playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/b95f1b4a9b8ae5a7143f0a9d7ff6dcc7.poster.avif?t=1752001659\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/b95f1b4a9b8ae5a7143f0a9d7ff6dcc7.webm?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/b95f1b4a9b8ae5a7143f0a9d7ff6dcc7.mp4?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIght in PVP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players worldwide in fast-paced PvP matches or private duels. Outsmart, outplay, and outlast every opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/c40f5670c29755857b79930b92fcff82.poster.avif?t=1752001659\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/c40f5670c29755857b79930b92fcff82.webm?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/c40f5670c29755857b79930b92fcff82.mp4?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Clan </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit randomly generated ninjas, each with unique traits and backstories, and build the ultimate squad.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/3df6086cc60f5461096addf82b329df3.poster.avif?t=1752001659\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/3df6086cc60f5461096addf82b329df3.webm?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/3df6086cc60f5461096addf82b329df3.mp4?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level up your ninja!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience to unlock new ninjas, weapons, abilities, and deep customization options to sharpen your clan\u2019s power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/f61c095b1b8e0861c0198f62eec513a1.poster.avif?t=1752001659\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/f61c095b1b8e0861c0198f62eec513a1.webm?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/f61c095b1b8e0861c0198f62eec513a1.mp4?t=1752001659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And This is Just the Beginning:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New ninjas, arenas, jutsus, and surprises are on the way. Your legend is just getting started.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846510/extras/d263f7f4af61950ff92ec39c6746bdfa.avif?t=1752001659\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
